          "type": "select",
          "valueLabels": {
            "normal": {
              "en": "Normal",
              "zh-Hans": "正常"
            },
            "off": {
              "en": "Off",
              "zh-Hans": "关"
            },
            "weak": {
              "en": "Weak",
              "zh-Hans": "弱"
            }
          },
          "values": [
            "off",
            "weak",
            "normal"
          ]
        },
        {
          "categoryId": "video",
          "defaultValue": "accurate",
          "description": {
            "en": "Specify video rendering method. 'Accurate' is slowest, but most exact. 'Good' is faster, but fails if colors change mid-frame too often. 'Fast' renders the complete frame in one pass, and is incompatible with games that rely on mid-frame palette/sprite table updates.",
            "zh-Hans": "「精确」最慢但最准确；「良好」更快，但画面中途频繁改色时会出错；「快速」一次性渲染整帧，不兼容依赖中途改色的游戏。"
          },
